<view class="page {{role}} "><include src="../../templates/load-status.wxml"/><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">把心意，送给特别的人</view><view class="subtitle">定向手机号，一次性领取，创建时预占权益。</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:30rpx"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">接收人手机号</text><input value="{{form.phone}}" type="number" maxlength="11" bindinput="input" data-field="phone" placeholder="仅该手机号登录后可领"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">礼包权益 / 注</text><input value="{{form.quantity}}" type="number" bindinput="input" data-field="quantity"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="createGift" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">创建并预占</button></view><view class="card record" wx:for="{{gifts}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="status">{{labels[item.status]}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.maskedPhone}} · {{item.betCount}}注 · 24小时有效</view><view class="record-actions" wx:if="{{item.status==='CREATED'}}"><button class="secondary small" bindtap="copyGift" data-token="{{item.token}}">复制一次性口令</button><button class="secondary small" bindtap="revokeGift" data-id="{{item.id}}">撤销并释放</button></view></view></block></view>